      <h2>Sewer Route Steps</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>1. Enter with a clear objective</h3>
          <p>Decide whether you are chasing the sewer key route, the Cosmic Cash Vine vault, or the UFO key route. Mixing goals is why players lose track of the maze.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>2. Mark the main split</h3>
          <p>Use the first large branch as your reset point. If you reach a dead end or pull the wrong lever, return to this split before trying the next branch.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>3. Solve levers before the vault</h3>
          <p>The lever route should be completed as a checklist. Open the dedicated lever sequence page on mobile before entering the vault section.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>4. Separate UFO key progress</h3>
          <p>The UFO key path belongs after the Good Samaritan route. Do not assume a vault step also completes the UFO objective unless the game confirms it.</p>
        </section>
